              </h3>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                  <div className="md:col-span-3">
                      <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Patología / Diagnóstico</label>
                      <textarea 
                        value={sickLeaveData.diagnosis}
                        onChange={(e) => setSickLeaveData(prev => ({ ...prev, diagnosis: e.target.value }))}
                        rows={3}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none resize-none"
                        placeholder="Describa la condición médica..."
                      />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                      <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Días de Reposo</label>
                      <input 
                        type="number"
                        min="1"
                        value={sickLeaveData.days}
                        onChange={(e) => setSickLeaveData(prev => ({ ...prev, days: parseInt(e.target.value) || 1 }))}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none font-bold text-xl text-blue-600"
                      />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                      <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Fecha de Inicio (Desde)</label>
                      <input 
                        type="date"
                        value={sickLeaveData.startDate}
                        onChange={(e) => setSickLeaveData(prev => ({ ...prev, startDate: e.target.value }))}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none"
                      />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                      <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Fecha de Culminación (Hasta)</label>
                      <div className="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-700">
                          {formatDate(sickLeaveData.endDate)}
                      </div>
                  </div>
              </div>
              <div className="mt-8 flex justify-end">
                  <button 
                    onClick={handleSaveSickLeave}
                    className="flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-green-700 font-bold shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
                  >
                      <Save className="w-5 h-5" /> Guardar y Previsualizar
                  </button>
              </div>
          </div>
      )}

      {/* --- PREVIEW AND PRINT AREA --- */}
      {selectedAttention && patient && (
          <div className="animate-in fade-in duration-500">
              <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-6 print:hidden">
                  <button 
                    onClick={() => setSelectedAttention(null)}
                    className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-blue-600 flex items-center gap-1"
                  >
                      ← Volver a Editar / Nueva Búsqueda
                  </button>
                  <button 
                      onClick={() => window.print()}
                      className="px-8 py-3 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-900 font-bold shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2"
                  >
                      <Printer className="w-5 h-5" /> Imprimir Documento
                  </button>
              </div>

              {/* PDF REPRODUCTION */}
              <div className="bg-white shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 w-full max-w-[216mm] mx-auto min-h-[279mm] p-[20mm] print:shadow-none print:border-0 print:w-full print:p-0 flex flex-col">
                  {renderHeader()}

                  <div className="flex-1 space-y-8 text-slate-900 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    <div className="text-center mb-8">
                        <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold uppercase underline tracking-tighter">Constancia de Reposo Médico</h2>
                    </div>

                    <p className="text-justify indent-8 text-base">
                        Por medio de la presente se certifica que el trabajador(a) <strong>{patient.firstName}</strong>, titular de la Cédula de Identidad <strong>{patient.cedula}</strong>, quien desempeña el cargo de <strong>{patient.jobTitle}</strong> en la empresa <strong>{patient.company}</strong>, ha sido evaluado(a) médicamente en esta fecha.
                    </p>

                    <div className="bg-slate-50 p-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                        <h4 className="text-xs font-black text-slate-400 uppercase mb-2 tracking-widest">Diagnóstico Médico</h4>
                        <p className="text-lg font-bold italic">"{selectedAttention.diagnosis}"</p>
                    </div>

                    <p className="text-justify text-base">
                        Debido a la condición anteriormente descrita, se le indica <strong>REPOSO MÉDICO</strong> por un lapso de 
                        <span className="text-xl font-black mx-2 border-b-2 border-slate-900 px-2">{selectedAttention.restDays}</span> 
                        días continuos.
                    </p>

                    <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 py-4">
                        <div className="text-center p-4 border-2 border-slate-100 rounded-2xl">
                            <p className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Fecha de Inicio</p>
                            <p className="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900">{formatDate(selectedAttention.restStartDate)}</p>
                        </div>
                        <div className="text-center p-4 border-2 border-slate-100 rounded-2xl">
                            <p className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Fecha de Reincorporación</p>
                            <p className="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900">{formatDate(new Date(new Date(selectedAttention.restEndDate).getTime() + 86400000).toISOString())}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-500 italic mt-12 text-center">
                        "Documento válido para fines administrativos y epidemiológicos. El trabajador debe consignar este comprobante a su departamento de RRHH."
                    </p>
                  </div>

                  {renderSignature()}

                  <div className="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-[9px] text-center text-slate-400 font-mono">
                      GENERADO POR SISTEMA ALEX CONSULTING v2.0 • ID: {selectedAttention.id.substring(0,8).toUpperCase()} • {new Date().toLocaleString()}
                  </div>
              </div>
          </div>
      )}

      {/* --- INITIAL STATE --- */}
      {!patient && !isSearching && (
          <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 text-slate-300">
              <ClipboardList className="w-20 h-20 mb-4 opacity-20" />
              <p className="font-medium text-lg">Ingrese la cédula para comenzar la gestión del reposo</p>
          </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
};

export default MedicalReportGenerator;

import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo } from 'react';
import { getAllMedicalAttentions, getAllPatients, getCompanies, getDoctors } from '../utils/storage';
import { MedicalAttention, Patient, Company, Doctor } from '../types';
import { Printer, ShieldCheck, Building2 } from 'lucide-react';

type Quarter = 'I' | 'II' | 'III' | 'IV';

const SVEReport: React.FC = () => {
  const [selectedYear, setSelectedYear] = useState<number>(new Date().getFullYear());
  const [selectedQuarter, setSelectedQuarter] = useState<Quarter>('I');
  const [allPatients, setAllPatients] = useState<Patient[]>([]);
  const [allAttentions, setAllAttentions] = useState<MedicalAttention[]>([]);
  const [companies, setCompanies] = useState<Company[]>([]);
  const [doctors, setDoctors] = useState<Doctor[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [selectedCompanyName, setSelectedCompanyName] = useState<string>('');

  useEffect(() => {
    const fetchData = async () => {
      setLoading(true);
      try {
        const [pats, atts, comps, docs] = await Promise.all([
            getAllPatients(), 
            getAllMedicalAttentions(),
            getCompanies(),
            getDoctors()
        ]);
        setAllPatients(pats);
        setAllAttentions(atts);
        setCompanies(comps);
        setDoctors(docs);
      } catch (e) {
        console.error("Error fetching data", e);
      } finally {
        setLoading(false);
      }
    };
    fetchData();
  }, []);

  const getQuarterMonths = (q: Quarter) => {
    switch (q) {
      case 'I': return [0, 1, 2];
      case 'II': return [3, 4, 5];
      case 'III': return [6, 7, 8];
      case 'IV': return [9, 10, 11];
    }
  };

  const getMonthName = (monthIndex: number) => {
    return new Date(2024, monthIndex, 1).toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { month: 'long' });
  };

  const calculateAge = (birthDateString: string) => {
    const today = new Date();
    const birthDate = new Date(birthDateString);
    let age = today.getFullYear() - birthDate.getFullYear();
    const m = today.getMonth() - birthDate.getMonth();
    if (m < 0 || (m === 0 && today.getDate() < birthDate.getDate())) age--;
    return age;
  };

  const patientsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allPatients;
      return allPatients.filter(p => p.company === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [allPatients, selectedCompanyName]);

  const attentionsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allAttentions;
      const patientCedulas = new Set(patientsInScope.map(p => p.cedula));
      return allAttentions.filter(a => patientCedulas.has(a.patientCedula));
  }, [allAttentions, patientsInScope, selectedCompanyName]);

  const currentCompany = useMemo(() => {
      return companies.find(c => c.name === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [companies, selectedCompanyName]);

  const quarterAttentions = useMemo(() => {
    const months = getQuarterMonths(selectedQuarter);
    return attentionsInScope.filter(att => {
      const d = new Date(att.attentionDate);
      return d.getFullYear() === selectedYear && months.includes(d.getMonth());
    });
  }, [attentionsInScope, selectedYear, selectedQuarter]);

  const examStats = useMemo(() => {
    const data = {
      'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Prevacacional': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Postvacacional (Periódica)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Egreso': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Especiales / Otros': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
    };

    quarterAttentions.forEach(att => {
       let key: keyof typeof data | null = null;
       if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Empleo') key = 'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Vacaciones') key = 'Prevacacional';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Egreso') key = 'Egreso';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Periódica') key = 'Postvacacional (Periódica)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'General') key = 'Especiales / Otros';

       if (key && data[key]) {
           data[key].Total++;
           const result = att.evaluationResult;
           if (result === 'Apto') data[key].Apto++;
           else if (result === 'No Apto') data[key]['No Apto']++;
           else if (result === 'Postpuesta') data[key].Postpuesta++;
           else data[key]['No Aplica']++;
       }
    });
    return data;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const structuredMorbidity = useMemo(() => {
     return {
        'Accidentes Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Común'),
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional'),
        'Enfermedades Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común'),
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional'),
     };
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const restStats = useMemo(() => {
     const stats = {
        'Accidentes Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': { count: 0, days: 0 },
     };
     quarterAttentions.forEach(a => {
        let key = '';
        if (a.reason === 'Accidente Común') key = 'Accidentes Comunes';
        else if (a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional') key = 'Accidentes de Trabajo';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común') key = 'Enfermedades Comunes';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional') key = 'Enfermedades Ocupacionales';

        if (key && a.restDays > 0) {
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].count++;
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].days += a.restDays;
        }
     });
     return stats;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const HeaderSection = () => (
    <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-6 border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4">
       <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300">
             {currentCompany ? <Building2 className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-400"/> : "LOGO"}
          </div>
          <div>
             <h1 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">
                 {currentCompany?.name || 'ENTIDAD DE TRABAJO'}
             </h1>
             <p className="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">RIF: {currentCompany?.rif || 'N/A'}</p>
             <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">Servicio de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo</p>
          </div>
       </div>
       <div className="text-right">
          <h2 className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase">Informe Trimestral SVE</h2>
          <p className="text-xs font-medium text-slate-700">Trimestre: {selectedQuarter} - Año: {selectedYear}</p>
          <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1 uppercase">LOPCYMAT / NT-03-2016 / NT-04-2023</p>
       </div>
    </div>
  );

  const FooterSignatures = ({ pageType }: { pageType: 'first' | 'middle' | 'last' }) => (
    <div className="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div className="text-center">
           <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
           <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Médico Ocupacional</p>
           <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Suscrito en todas las páginas</p>
        </div>
        {(pageType === 'first' || pageType === 'last') && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Seguridad e Higiene</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Reg. INPSASEL</p>
          </div>
        )}
        {pageType === 'last' && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Representante CSSL</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Delegado / Patrono</p>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
      <div className="flex justify-between text-[8px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-mono">
         <span>Alex Consulting SVE Report</span>
         <span className="page-number-display">Página </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  );

  if (loading) return <div className="p-8 text-center text-slate-500">Preparando reporte epidemiológico...</div>;

  return (
    <div className="max-w-5xl mx-auto pb-20">

      {/* Controls */}
      <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8 print:hidden flex flex-col gap-4">
         <div className="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
            <h2 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">Generador SVE (Normativa 2024)</h2>
         </div>
         <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-end">
            <div className="flex-1 min-w-[200px]">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Entidad de Trabajo</label>
               <select 
                 value={selectedCompanyName}
                 onChange={(e) => setSelectedCompanyName(e.target.value)}
                 className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
               >
                   <option value="">-- Seleccionar --</option>
                   {companies.map(c => <option key={c.id} value={c.name}>{c.name}</option>)}
               </select>
            </div>
            <div className="w-24">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Año</label>
               <input type="number" value={selectedYear} onChange={e => setSelectedYear(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm" />
            </div>
            <div className="w-32">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Trimestre</label>
               <select value={selectedQuarter} onChange={e => setSelectedQuarter(e.target.value as Quarter)} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                  <option value="I">Ene-Mar</option>
                  <option value="II">Abr-Jun</option>
                  <option value="III">Jul-Sep</option>
                  <option value="IV">Oct-Dic</option>
               </select>
            </div>
            <button onClick={() => window.print()} className="px-6 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
              <Printer className="w-4 h-4" /> Generar PDF
            </button>
         </div>
      </div>

      {/* REPORT VIEW */}
      <div className="print-container text-slate-900 bg-white md:p-12 print:p-0 rounded-xl shadow-2xl print:shadow-none">

        <style>{`
          @media print {
            body { background: white; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
            .print-hidden { display: none !important; }
            .page-break { 
              page-break-after: always; 
              min-height: 297mm; 
              display: flex; 
              flex-direction: column; 
              padding: 15mm; 
              position: relative;
            }
            .page-break:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
            @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
            .page-number-display::after { content: counter(page); }
          }
          .page-break { min-height: 297mm; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: white; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20mm; }
          table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
          th, td { border: 1px solid #94a3b8; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }
          th { background-color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1e293b; font-size: 9px; }
          .section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #1e293b; margin: 15px 0 10px 0; padding-bottom: 2px; color: #0f172a; }
          .legal-intro { font-size: 10px; color: #475569; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.4; }
        `}</style>

        {/* PAGINA 1: REGISTRO MENSUAL */}
        <div className="page-break" style={{ counterReset: 'page 1' }}>
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="text-center mb-6">
                  <h1 className="text-xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-tighter">SISTEMA DE VIGILANCIA EPIDEMIOLÓGICA (SVE)</h1>
               </div>

               <div className="legal-intro">
                  Según lo indicado en la LOPCYMAT y NT-04-2023, se presenta el informe de vigilancia epidemiológica para <strong>{selectedCompanyName || 'ENTIDAD DE TRABAJO'}</strong> correspondiente al trimestre {selectedQuarter} del año {selectedYear}.
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">1.- Registro mensual de la cantidad de trabajadores discriminados</div>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Mes / Período</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Total</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Masculino</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Femenino</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Discapacidad</th>
                        <th className="text-center">18-24</th>
                        <th className="text-center">25-34</th>
                        <th className="text-center">35-44</th>
                        <th className="text-center">45-54</th>
                        <th className="text-center">55+</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {getQuarterMonths(selectedQuarter).map(monthIdx => {
                        const stats = { total: 0, m: 0, f: 0, d: 0, a1: 0, a2: 0, a3: 0, a4: 0, a5: 0 };
                        patientsInScope.forEach(p => {
                            stats.total++;
                            if (p.gender === 'Masculino') stats.m++; else stats.f++;
                            if (p.hasDisability) stats.d++;
                            const age = calculateAge(p.birthDate);
                            if (age < 25) stats.a1++;
                            else if (age < 35) stats.a2++;
                            else if (age < 45) stats.a3++;
                            else if (age < 55) stats.a4++;
                            else stats.a5++;
                        });

                        return (
                           <tr key={monthIdx}>
                              <td className="font-bold">{getMonthName(monthIdx).toUpperCase()}</td>
                              <td className="text-center font-bold">{stats.total}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.m}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.f}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.d}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a1}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a2}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a3}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a4}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a5}</td>
                           </tr>
                        );
                     })}
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="section-title">2.- Registro de los Accidentes Comunes</div>
               {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes Comunes'].length > 0 ? (
                  <table>
                     <thead>
                        <tr>
                           <th>Fecha</th>
                           <th>Diagnóstico / Patología</th>
                           <th>Reposo (Días)</th>
                        </tr>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes Comunes'].map(a => (
                           <tr key={a.id}>
                              <td>{a.attentionDate}</td>
                              <td>{a.diagnosis}</td>
                              <td>{a.restDays} d</td>
                           </tr>
                        ))}
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
               ) : <p className="text-[10px] italic text-slate-400 py-2 text-center">No hay registros en este período.</p>}

               <div className="section-title">3.- Registro de los Accidentes de Trabajo</div>
               {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].length > 0 ? (
                  <table>
                     <thead>
                        <tr>
                           <th>Fecha</th>
                           <th>Puesto de Trabajo</th>
                           <th>Sistema Afectado / Lesión</th>
                           <th>Reposo</th>
                        </tr>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].map(a => (
                           <tr key={a.id}>
                              <td>{a.attentionDate}</td>
                              <td>{patientsInScope.find(p => p.cedula === a.patientCedula)?.jobTitle || 'N/A'}</td>
                              <td>{a.diagnosis}</td>
                              <td>{a.restDays} d</td>
                           </tr>
                        ))}
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
               ) : <p className="text-[10px] italic text-slate-400 py-2 text-center">Sin accidentes de trabajo reportados.</p>}
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="first" />
        </div>

        {/* PAGINA 2: ENFERMEDADES Y EXAMENES */}
        <div className="page-break">
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="section-title">4.- Registro de Enfermedades (Comunes y Ocupacionales)</div>
               <div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
                  <div>
                     <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1">4.1 Enfermedades Comunes</h4>
                     <table>
                        <thead>
                           <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Diagnóstico</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           {structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Comunes'].length > 0 ? structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Comunes'].map(a => (
                              <tr key={a.id}><td>{a.attentionDate}</td><td>{a.diagnosis}</td></tr>
                           )) : <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center text-slate-400 italic py-1">Sin registros</td></tr>}
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                     <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1">4.2 Enfermedades Ocupacionales</h4>
                     <table>
                        <thead>
                           <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sistema Corp. Afectado</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           {structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Ocupacionales'].length > 0 ? structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Ocupacionales'].map(a => (
                              <tr key={a.id}><td>{a.attentionDate}</td><td>{a.diagnosis}</td></tr>
                           )) : <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center text-slate-400 italic py-1">Sin registros</td></tr>}
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                  </div>
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">5.- Resultados de Exámenes y Evaluaciones de Salud</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Cantidad de evaluaciones practicadas discriminadas por aptitud médica.</p>
               <table className="text-center">
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th className="text-left">Tipo de Evaluación Practicada</th>
                        <th>Apto</th>
                        <th>No Apto</th>
                        <th>Postpuesta</th>
                        <th>No Aplica</th>
                        <th className="bg-slate-200">Total</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {(Object.entries(examStats) as [string, { Apto: number, 'No Apto': number, Postpuesta: number, 'No Aplica': number, Total: number }][]).map(([type, s]) => (
                        <tr key={type}>
                           <td className="text-left font-medium">{type}</td>
                           <td>{s.Apto}</td>
                           <td>{s['No Apto']}</td>
                           <td>{s.Postpuesta}</td>
                           <td>{s['No Aplica']}</td>
                           <td className="font-bold bg-slate-50">{s.Total}</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="section-title">6.- Referencias a Centros Especializados</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Casos referidos a interconsultas con especialistas externos.</p>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Especialista / Centro de Salud</th>
                        <th>Causa o Motivo de la Referencia</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.medicalReferral).map((a, idx) => (
                        <tr key={idx}>
                           <td className="font-medium">{a.medicalReferral}</td>
                           <td>{a.diagnosis.substring(0, 100)}...</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                     {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.medicalReferral).length === 0 && (
                        <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center italic text-slate-400 py-3">No hay referencias médicas registradas en el trimestre.</td></tr>
                     )}
                  </tbody>
               </table>
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="middle" />
        </div>

        {/* PAGINA 3: REPOSOS Y ESTADISTICAS */}
        <div className="page-break">
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="section-title">7.- Registro de los Reposos (Cantidad y Tiempo)</div>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Categoría de Reposo Médico</th>
                        <th className="text-center">N° de Casos</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Días Perdidos Totales</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {(Object.entries(restStats) as [string, { count: number, days: number }][]).map(([cat, s]) => (
                        <tr key={cat}>
                           <td className="font-medium">{cat}</td>
                           <td className="text-center font-bold">{s.count}</td>
                           <td className="text-center font-bold bg-slate-50">{s.days} d</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="section-title">8.- Personas con Discapacidad Atendidas</div>
               <p className="text-[10px]">Total de trabajadores con discapacidad: <strong>{patientsInScope.filter(p => p.hasDisability).length}</strong></p>

               <div className="section-title">9.- Factores de Riesgo y Procesos Peligrosos</div>
               <div className="p-3 bg-slate-50 border rounded text-[9px] leading-relaxed">
                  Basado en el Programa de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo (PSST), se vigilan procesos peligrosos físicos (ruido, iluminación), disergonómicos (posturas forzadas) y psicosociales.
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">10.- Medidas de Control Propuestas y Realizadas</div>
               <ul className="text-[9px] list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                  <li>Pausas activas y gimnasia laboral periódica.</li>
                  <li>Uso obligatorio de Equipos de Protección Personal (EPP).</li>
                  <li>Reubicación de puestos según vigilancia epidemiológica.</li>
               </ul>

               <div className="section-title">11.- Estadísticas de Accidentalidad y Morbilidad</div>
               <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  <div className="p-2 border rounded bg-slate-50 text-[9px]">
                     <p className="font-bold border-b mb-1">Frecuencia Bruta (IFB)</p>
                     <p className="text-blue-600 font-bold">IFB: {((structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].length / (patientsInScope.length || 1)) * 100).toFixed(2)}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div className="p-2 border rounded bg-slate-50 text-[9px]">
                     <p className="font-bold border-b mb-1">Índice de Gravedad (IG)</p>
                     <p className="text-blue-600 font-bold">IG: {((restStats['Accidentes de Trabajo'].days / (patientsInScope.length || 1)) * 100).toFixed(2)}</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="last" />
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

export default SVEReport;

import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo } from 'react';
import { getAllMedicalAttentions, getAllPatients, getCompanies, getDoctors } from '../utils/storage';
import { MedicalAttention, Patient, Company, Doctor } from '../types';
import { Printer, ShieldCheck, Building2, Table as TableIcon } from 'lucide-react';

type Quarter = 'I' | 'II' | 'III' | 'IV';

const SVEReport: React.FC = () => {
  const [selectedYear, setSelectedYear] = useState<number>(new Date().getFullYear());
  const [selectedQuarter, setSelectedQuarter] = useState<Quarter>('I');
  const [allPatients, setAllPatients] = useState<Patient[]>([]);
  const [allAttentions, setAllAttentions] = useState<MedicalAttention[]>([]);
  const [companies, setCompanies] = useState<Company[]>([]);
  const [doctors, setDoctors] = useState<Doctor[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [selectedCompanyName, setSelectedCompanyName] = useState<string>('');

  useEffect(() => {
    const fetchData = async () => {
      setLoading(true);
      try {
        const [pats, atts, comps, docs] = await Promise.all([
            getAllPatients(), 
            getAllMedicalAttentions(),
            getCompanies(),
            getDoctors()
        ]);
        setAllPatients(pats);
        setAllAttentions(atts);
        setCompanies(comps);
        setDoctors(docs);
      } catch (e) {
        console.error("Error fetching data", e);
      } finally {
        setLoading(false);
      }
    };
    fetchData();
  }, []);

  const getQuarterMonths = (q: Quarter) => {
    switch (q) {
      case 'I': return [0, 1, 2];
      case 'II': return [3, 4, 5];
      case 'III': return [6, 7, 8];
      case 'IV': return [9, 10, 11];
    }
  };

  const getMonthName = (monthIndex: number) => {
    return new Date(2024, monthIndex, 1).toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { month: 'long' });
  };

  const calculateAge = (birthDateString: string) => {
    const today = new Date();
    const birthDate = new Date(birthDateString);
    let age = today.getFullYear() - birthDate.getFullYear();
    const m = today.getMonth() - birthDate.getMonth();
    if (m < 0 || (m === 0 && today.getDate() < birthDate.getDate())) age--;
    return age;
  };

  const patientsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allPatients;
      return allPatients.filter(p => p.company === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [allPatients, selectedCompanyName]);

  const attentionsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allAttentions;
      const patientCedulas = new Set(patientsInScope.map(p => p.cedula));
      return allAttentions.filter(a => patientCedulas.has(a.patientCedula));
  }, [allAttentions, patientsInScope, selectedCompanyName]);

  const currentCompany = useMemo(() => {
      return companies.find(c => c.name === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [companies, selectedCompanyName]);

  const quarterAttentions = useMemo(() => {
    const months = getQuarterMonths(selectedQuarter);
    return attentionsInScope.filter(att => {
      const d = new Date(att.attentionDate);
      return d.getFullYear() === selectedYear && months.includes(d.getMonth());
    });
  }, [attentionsInScope, selectedYear, selectedQuarter]);

  const examStats = useMemo(() => {
    const data = {
      'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Prevacacional': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Postvacacional (Periódica)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Egreso': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Especiales / Otros': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
    };

    quarterAttentions.forEach(att => {
       let key: keyof typeof data | null = null;
       if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Empleo') key = 'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Vacaciones') key = 'Prevacacional';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Egreso') key = 'Egreso';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Periódica') key = 'Postvacacional (Periódica)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'General') key = 'Especiales / Otros';

       if (key && data[key]) {
           data[key].Total++;
           const result = att.evaluationResult;
           if (result === 'Apto') data[key].Apto++;
           else if (result === 'No Apto') data[key]['No Apto']++;
           else if (result === 'Postpuesta') data[key].Postpuesta++;
           else data[key]['No Aplica']++;
       }
    });
    return data;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const structuredMorbidity = useMemo(() => {
     return {
        'Accidentes Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Común'),
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional'),
        'Enfermedades Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común'),
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional'),
     };
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const restStats = useMemo(() => {
     const stats = {
        'Accidentes Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': { count: 0, days: 0 },
     };
     quarterAttentions.forEach(a => {
        let key = '';
        if (a.reason === 'Accidente Común') key = 'Accidentes Comunes';
        else if (a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional') key = 'Accidentes de Trabajo';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común') key = 'Enfermedades Comunes';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional') key = 'Enfermedades Ocupacionales';

        if (key && a.restDays > 0) {
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].count++;
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].days += a.restDays;
        }
     });
     return stats;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const HeaderSection = () => (
    <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-6 border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4">
       <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300">
             {currentCompany ? <Building2 className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-400"/> : "LOGO"}
          </div>
          <div>
             <h1 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">
                 {currentCompany?.name || 'ENTIDAD DE TRABAJO'}
             </h1>
             <p className="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">RIF: {currentCompany?.rif || 'N/A'}</p>
             <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">Servicio de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo</p>
          </div>
       </div>
       <div className="text-right">
          <h2 className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase">Informe Trimestral SVE</h2>
          <p className="text-xs font-medium text-slate-700">Trimestre: {selectedQuarter} - Año: {selectedYear}</p>
          <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1 uppercase">LOPCYMAT / NT-03-2016 / NT-04-2023</p>
       </div>
    </div>
  );

  const FooterSignatures = ({ pageType }: { pageType: 'first' | 'middle' | 'last' }) => (
    <div className="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div className="text-center">
           <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
           <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Médico Ocupacional</p>
           <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Suscrito en todas las páginas</p>
        </div>
        {(pageType === 'first' || pageType === 'last') && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Seguridad e Higiene</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Reg. INPSASEL</p>
          </div>
        )}
        {pageType === 'last' && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Representante CSSL</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Delegado / Patrono</p>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
      <div className="flex justify-between text-[8px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-mono">
         <span>Alex Consulting SVE Report</span>
         <span className="page-number-display">Página </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  );

  if (loading) return <div className="p-8 text-center text-slate-500">Preparando reporte epidemiológico...</div>;

  return (
    <div className="max-w-5xl mx-auto pb-20">

      {/* Controls */}
      <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8 print:hidden flex flex-col gap-4">
         <div className="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
            <h2 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">Generador SVE (Normativa 2024)</h2>
         </div>
         <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-end">
            <div className="flex-1 min-w-[200px]">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Entidad de Trabajo</label>
               <select 
                 value={selectedCompanyName}
                 onChange={(e) => setSelectedCompanyName(e.target.value)}
                 className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
               >
                   <option value="">-- Seleccionar --</option>
                   {companies.map(c => <option key={c.id} value={c.name}>{c.name}</option>)}
               </select>
            </div>
            <div className="w-24">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Año</label>
               <input type="number" value={selectedYear} onChange={e => setSelectedYear(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm" />
            </div>
            <div className="w-32">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Trimestre</label>
               <select value={selectedQuarter} onChange={e => setSelectedQuarter(e.target.value as Quarter)} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                  <option value="I">Ene-Mar</option>
                  <option value="II">Abr-Jun</option>
                  <option value="III">Jul-Sep</option>
                  <option value="IV">Oct-Dic</option>
               </select>
            </div>
            <button onClick={() => window.print()} className="px-6 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
              <Printer className="w-4 h-4" /> Generar PDF
            </button>
         </div>
      </div>

      {/* REPORT VIEW */}
      <div className="print-container text-slate-900 bg-white md:p-12 print:p-0 rounded-xl shadow-2xl print:shadow-none">

        <style>{`
          @media print {
            body { background: white; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
            .print-hidden { display: none !important; }
            .page-break { 
              page-break-after: always; 
              min-height: 297mm; 
              display: flex; 
              flex-direction: column; 
              padding: 15mm; 
              position: relative;
            }
            .page-break:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
            @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
            .page-number-display::after { content: counter(page); }
          }
          .page-break { min-height: 297mm; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: white; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20mm; }
          table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
          th, td { border: 1px solid #94a3b8; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }
          th { background-color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1e293b; font-size: 9px; }
          .section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #1e293b; margin: 15px 0 10px 0; padding-bottom: 2px; color: #0f172a; }
          .legal-intro { font-size: 10px; color: #475569; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.4; }
          .bg-total { background-color: #f8fafc; font-weight: bold; }
        `}</style>

        {/* PAGINA 1: REGISTRO MENSUAL */}
        <div className="page-break" style={{ counterReset: 'page 1' }}>
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="text-center mb-6">
                  <h1 className="text-xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-tighter">SISTEMA DE VIGILANCIA EPIDEMIOLÓGICA (SVE)</h1>
               </div>

               <div className="legal-intro">
                  Según lo indicado en la LOPCYMAT y NT-04-2023, se presenta el informe de vigilancia epidemiológica para <strong>{selectedCompanyName || 'ENTIDAD DE TRABAJO'}</strong> correspondiente al trimestre {selectedQuarter} del año {selectedYear}.
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">1.- Registro mensual de la cantidad de trabajadores discriminados</div>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Mes / Período</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Total</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Masculino</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Femenino</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Discapacidad</th>
                        <th className="text-center">18-24</th>
                        <th className="text-center">25-34</th>
                        <th className="text-center">35-44</th>
                        <th className="text-center">45-54</th>
                        <th className="text-center">55+</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {getQuarterMonths(selectedQuarter).map(monthIdx => {
                        const stats = { total: 0, m: 0, f: 0, d: 0, a1: 0, a2: 0, a3: 0, a4: 0, a5: 0 };
                        patientsInScope.forEach(p => {
                            stats.total++;
                            if (p.gender === 'Masculino') stats.m++; else stats.f++;
                            if (p.hasDisability) stats.d++;
                            const age = calculateAge(p.birthDate);
                            if (age < 25) stats.a1++;
                            else if (age < 35) stats.a2++;
                            else if (age < 45) stats.a3++;
                            else if (age < 55) stats.a4++;
                            else stats.a5++;
                        });

                        return (
                           <tr key={monthIdx}>
                              <td className="font-bold">{getMonthName(monthIdx).toUpperCase()}</td>
                              <td className="text-center font-bold">{stats.total}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.m}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.f}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.d}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a1}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a2}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a3}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a4}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{stats.a5}</td>
                           </tr>
                        );
                     })}
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="section-title">2.- Registro de los Accidentes Comunes</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Consolidado epidemiológico de accidentes no relacionados con el trabajo.</p>
               {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes Comunes'].length > 0 ? (
                  <table>
                     <thead>
                        <tr>
                           <th>Fecha</th>
                           <th>Diagnóstico / Patología</th>
                           <th className="text-center">Reposo (Días)</th>
                        </tr>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes Comunes'].map(a => (
                           <tr key={a.id}>
                              <td>{a.attentionDate}</td>
                              <td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0]}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{a.restDays} d</td>
                           </tr>
                        ))}
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
               ) : <p className="text-[10px] italic text-slate-400 py-2 text-center">No se reportaron accidentes comunes en el período.</p>}

               <div className="section-title">3.- Registro de los Accidentes de Trabajo</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Consolidado epidemiológico de eventos ocurridos con ocasión del trabajo.</p>
               {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].length > 0 ? (
                  <table>
                     <thead>
                        <tr>
                           <th>Fecha</th>
                           <th>Puesto de Trabajo</th>
                           <th>Naturaleza de la Lesión / Diagnóstico</th>
                           <th className="text-center">Reposo</th>
                        </tr>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        {structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].map(a => (
                           <tr key={a.id}>
                              <td>{a.attentionDate}</td>
                              <td>{patientsInScope.find(p => p.cedula === a.patientCedula)?.jobTitle || 'N/A'}</td>
                              <td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0]}</td>
                              <td className="text-center">{a.restDays} d</td>
                           </tr>
                        ))}
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
               ) : <p className="text-[10px] italic text-slate-400 py-2 text-center">Sin accidentes de trabajo reportados.</p>}
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="first" />
        </div>

        {/* PAGINA 2: ENFERMEDADES Y EXAMENES */}
        <div className="page-break">
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="section-title">4.- Registro de Enfermedades (Comunes y Ocupacionales)</div>
               <div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
                  <div>
                     <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-1">
                       <TableIcon className="w-3 h-3"/> 4.1 Enfermedades Comunes
                     </h4>
                     <table>
                        <thead>
                           <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Diagnóstico / Sistema Afectado</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           {structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Comunes'].length > 0 ? structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Comunes'].map(a => (
                              <tr key={a.id}><td>{a.attentionDate}</td><td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0]}</td></tr>
                           )) : <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center text-slate-400 italic py-1">Sin registros</td></tr>}
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                     <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-1">
                        <TableIcon className="w-3 h-3"/> 4.2 Enfermedades Ocupacionales
                     </h4>
                     <table>
                        <thead>
                           <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sistema Corp. Afectado / Presunción Diagnóstica</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           {structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Ocupacionales'].length > 0 ? structuredMorbidity['Enfermedades Ocupacionales'].map(a => (
                              <tr key={a.id}><td>{a.attentionDate}</td><td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0]}</td></tr>
                           )) : <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center text-slate-400 italic py-1">Sin registros ocupacionales confirmados o bajo sospecha</td></tr>}
                        </tbody>
                     </table>
                  </div>
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">5.- Resultados de Exámenes y Evaluaciones de Salud</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Matriz de aptitud médica por tipo de evaluación practicada en el período.</p>
               <table className="text-center">
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th className="text-left">Evaluación Practicada</th>
                        <th>Apto</th>
                        <th>No Apto</th>
                        <th>Postpuesta</th>
                        <th>No Aplica</th>
                        <th className="bg-slate-200">Cantidad</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {(Object.entries(examStats) as [string, { Apto: number, 'No Apto': number, Postpuesta: number, 'No Aplica': number, Total: number }][]).map(([type, s]) => (
                        <tr key={type}>
                           <td className="text-left font-medium">{type}</td>
                           <td className={s.Apto > 0 ? "font-bold" : "text-slate-300"}>{s.Apto || '0'}</td>
                           <td className={s['No Apto'] > 0 ? "font-bold text-red-600" : "text-slate-300"}>{s['No Apto'] || '0'}</td>
                           <td className={s.Postpuesta > 0 ? "font-bold text-orange-600" : "text-slate-300"}>{s.Postpuesta || '0'}</td>
                           <td className={s['No Aplica'] > 0 ? "font-bold" : "text-slate-300"}>{s['No Aplica'] || '0'}</td>
                           <td className="bg-total">{s.Total}</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                     <tr className="bg-slate-100 font-bold">
                        <td className="text-left">TOTALES TRIMESTRALES</td>
                        <td>{Object.values(examStats).reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr.Apto, 0)}</td>
                        <td>{Object.values(examStats).reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr['No Apto'], 0)}</td>
                        <td>{Object.values(examStats).reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr.Postpuesta, 0)}</td>
                        <td>{Object.values(examStats).reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr['No Aplica'], 0)}</td>
                        <td className="bg-slate-800 text-white">{Object.values(examStats).reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr.Total, 0)}</td>
                     </tr>
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="section-title">6.- Referencias a Centros Especializados</div>
               <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mb-2 italic">Registro de interconsultas y derivaciones a especialistas externos.</p>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Especialista / Centro de Salud Receptor</th>
                        <th>Causa o Motivo de la Referencia / Especialidad</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.medicalReferral).map((a, idx) => (
                        <tr key={idx}>
                           <td className="font-bold">{a.medicalReferral}</td>
                           <td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0].substring(0, 120)}</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                     {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.medicalReferral).length === 0 && (
                        <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center italic text-slate-400 py-3">No se emitieron referencias médicas en este trimestre.</td></tr>
                     )}
                  </tbody>
               </table>
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="middle" />
        </div>

        {/* PAGINA 3: REPOSOS Y ESTADISTICAS */}
        <div className="page-break">
            <HeaderSection />
            <div className="flex-1">
               <div className="section-title">7.- Registro de los Reposos (Discriminado por Cantidad y Tiempo)</div>

               <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1">7.1 Resumen Estadístico de Reposos</h4>
               <table>
                  <thead>
                     <tr>
                        <th>Categoría de Reposo Médico</th>
                        <th className="text-center">N° de Casos</th>
                        <th className="text-center">Días Perdidos Totales</th>
                     </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                     {(Object.entries(restStats) as [string, { count: number, days: number }][]).map(([cat, s]) => (
                        <tr key={cat}>
                           <td className="font-medium">{cat}</td>
                           <td className="text-center font-bold">{s.count}</td>
                           <td className="text-center font-bold bg-slate-50">{s.days} d</td>
                        </tr>
                     ))}
                  </tbody>
               </table>

               <div className="mt-4">
                  <h4 className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase mb-1">7.2 Registro Detallado de Reposos (Especialista y Motivo)</h4>
                  <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500 mb-2">Listado epidemiológico anonimizado de causas de ausencia por salud.</p>
                  <table>
                     <thead>
                        <tr>
                           <th>Especialista / Médico Tratante</th>
                           <th>Causa o Motivo del Reposo</th>
                        </tr>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.restDays > 0).map((a, idx) => (
                           <tr key={idx}>
                              <td className="font-medium">{a.doctorName || 'Médico Ocupacional SSST'}</td>
                              <td>{a.diagnosis.split('\n')[0]}</td>
                           </tr>
                        ))}
                        {quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.restDays > 0).length === 0 && (
                           <tr><td colSpan={2} className="text-center italic text-slate-400 py-2">No se registraron días de reposo en el trimestre.</td></tr>
                        )}
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">8.- Personas con Discapacidad Atendidas</div>
               <p className="text-[10px]">Total de trabajadores con discapacidad en nómina activa: <strong>{patientsInScope.filter(p => p.hasDisability).length}</strong></p>

               <div className="section-title">9.- Factores de Riesgo y Procesos Peligrosos</div>
               <div className="p-3 bg-slate-50 border rounded text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-justify">
                  La vigilancia epidemiológica se ha enfocado en los procesos peligrosos identificados en el Programa de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo (PSST), priorizando la prevención de trastornos musculoesqueléticos derivados de posturas sedentes/forzadas y riesgos psicosociales asociados a la organización del trabajo.
               </div>

               <div className="section-title">10.- Medidas de Control Propuestas y Realizadas</div>
               <ul className="text-[9px] list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                  <li>Ejecución de pausas activas dirigidas a la mitigación de fatiga muscular.</li>
                  <li>Inspecciones ergonómicas a puestos de trabajo administrativo y operativo.</li>
                  <li>Charlas de inducción y refrescamiento sobre riesgos específicos del cargo.</li>
                  <li>Entrega y vigilancia del uso de Equipos de Protección Personal (EPP) según matriz de riesgo.</li>
               </ul>

               <div className="section-title">11.- Estadísticas de Accidentalidad y Morbilidad</div>
               <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  <div className="p-3 border rounded bg-slate-50 text-[9px]">
                     <p className="font-bold border-b mb-1 uppercase text-slate-500">Frecuencia Bruta (IFB)</p>
                     <p className="text-blue-600 font-black text-lg">
                       {((structuredMorbidity['Accidentes de Trabajo'].length / (patientsInScope.length || 1)) * 100).toFixed(2)}
                     </p>
                     <p className="text-[7px] text-slate-400">Fórmula: (N° Accidentes / N° Trabajadores) * 100</p>
                  </div>
                  <div className="p-3 border rounded bg-slate-50 text-[9px]">
                     <p className="font-bold border-b mb-1 uppercase text-slate-500">Índice de Gravedad (IG)</p>
                     <p className="text-blue-600 font-black text-lg">
                       {((restStats['Accidentes de Trabajo'].days / (patientsInScope.length || 1)) * 100).toFixed(2)}
                     </p>
                     <p className="text-[7px] text-slate-400">Fórmula: (Días Perdidos / N° Trabajadores) * 100</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
            <FooterSignatures pageType="last" />
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

export default SVEReport;

import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo } from 'react';
import { getAllMedicalAttentions, getAllPatients, getCompanies, getDoctors } from '../utils/storage';
import { MedicalAttention, Patient, Company, Doctor } from '../types';
import { Printer, ShieldCheck, Building2, Table as TableIcon } from 'lucide-react';

type Quarter = 'I' | 'II' | 'III' | 'IV';

const SVEReport: React.FC = () => {
  const [selectedYear, setSelectedYear] = useState<number>(new Date().getFullYear());
  const [selectedQuarter, setSelectedQuarter] = useState<Quarter>('I');
  const [allPatients, setAllPatients] = useState<Patient[]>([]);
  const [allAttentions, setAllAttentions] = useState<MedicalAttention[]>([]);
  const [companies, setCompanies] = useState<Company[]>([]);
  const [doctors, setDoctors] = useState<Doctor[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [selectedCompanyName, setSelectedCompanyName] = useState<string>('');

  useEffect(() => {
    const fetchData = async () => {
      setLoading(true);
      try {
        const [pats, atts, comps, docs] = await Promise.all([
            getAllPatients(), 
            getAllMedicalAttentions(),
            getCompanies(),
            getDoctors()
        ]);
        setAllPatients(pats);
        setAllAttentions(atts);
        setCompanies(comps);
        setDoctors(docs);
      } catch (e) {
        console.error("Error fetching data", e);
      } finally {
        setLoading(false);
      }
    };
    fetchData();
  }, []);

  const getQuarterMonths = (q: Quarter) => {
    switch (q) {
      case 'I': return [0, 1, 2];
      case 'II': return [3, 4, 5];
      case 'III': return [6, 7, 8];
      case 'IV': return [9, 10, 11];
    }
  };

  const getMonthName = (monthIndex: number) => {
    return new Date(2024, monthIndex, 1).toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { month: 'long' });
  };

  const calculateAge = (birthDateString: string) => {
    const today = new Date();
    const birthDate = new Date(birthDateString);
    let age = today.getFullYear() - birthDate.getFullYear();
    const m = today.getMonth() - birthDate.getMonth();
    if (m < 0 || (m === 0 && today.getDate() < birthDate.getDate())) age--;
    return age;
  };

  const patientsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allPatients;
      return allPatients.filter(p => p.company === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [allPatients, selectedCompanyName]);

  const attentionsInScope = useMemo(() => {
      if (!selectedCompanyName) return allAttentions;
      const patientCedulas = new Set(patientsInScope.map(p => p.cedula));
      return allAttentions.filter(a => patientCedulas.has(a.patientCedula));
  }, [allAttentions, patientsInScope, selectedCompanyName]);

  const currentCompany = useMemo(() => {
      return companies.find(c => c.name === selectedCompanyName);
  }, [companies, selectedCompanyName]);

  const quarterAttentions = useMemo(() => {
    const months = getQuarterMonths(selectedQuarter);
    return attentionsInScope.filter(att => {
      const d = new Date(att.attentionDate);
      return d.getFullYear() === selectedYear && months.includes(d.getMonth());
    });
  }, [attentionsInScope, selectedYear, selectedQuarter]);

  const examStats = useMemo(() => {
    const data = {
      'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Prevacacional': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Postvacacional (Periódica)': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Egreso': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
      'Especiales / Otros': { Apto: 0, 'No Apto': 0, Postpuesta: 0, 'No Aplica': 0, Total: 0 },
    };

    quarterAttentions.forEach(att => {
       let key: keyof typeof data | null = null;
       if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Empleo') key = 'Ingreso (Pre-empleo)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Pre Vacaciones') key = 'Prevacacional';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Egreso') key = 'Egreso';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'Periódica') key = 'Postvacacional (Periódica)';
       else if (att.attentionType === 'General') key = 'Especiales / Otros';

       if (key && data[key]) {
           data[key].Total++;
           const result = att.evaluationResult;
           if (result === 'Apto') data[key].Apto++;
           else if (result === 'No Apto') data[key]['No Apto']++;
           else if (result === 'Postpuesta') data[key].Postpuesta++;
           else data[key]['No Aplica']++;
       }
    });
    return data;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const structuredMorbidity = useMemo(() => {
     return {
        'Accidentes Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Común'),
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional'),
        'Enfermedades Comunes': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común'),
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': quarterAttentions.filter(a => a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional'),
     };
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const restStats = useMemo(() => {
     const stats = {
        'Accidentes Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Accidentes de Trabajo': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Comunes': { count: 0, days: 0 },
        'Enfermedades Ocupacionales': { count: 0, days: 0 },
     };
     quarterAttentions.forEach(a => {
        let key = '';
        if (a.reason === 'Accidente Común') key = 'Accidentes Comunes';
        else if (a.reason === 'Accidente Ocupacional') key = 'Accidentes de Trabajo';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Común') key = 'Enfermedad Común';
        else if (a.reason === 'Enfermedad Ocupacional') key = 'Enfermedad Ocupacional';

        if (key && a.restDays > 0) {
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].count++;
            stats[key as keyof typeof stats].days += a.restDays;
        }
     });
     return stats;
  }, [quarterAttentions]);

  const HeaderSection = () => (
    <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-6 border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4">
       <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300">
             {currentCompany ? <Building2 className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-400"/> : "LOGO"}
          </div>
          <div>
             <h1 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">
                 {currentCompany?.name || 'ENTIDAD DE TRABAJO'}
             </h1>
             <p className="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">RIF: {currentCompany?.rif || 'N/A'}</p>
             <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">Servicio de Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo</p>
          </div>
       </div>
       <div className="text-right">
          <h2 className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase">Informe Trimestral SVE</h2>
          <p className="text-xs font-medium text-slate-700">Trimestre: {selectedQuarter} - Año: {selectedYear}</p>
          <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1 uppercase">LOPCYMAT / NT-03-2016 / NT-04-2023</p>
       </div>
    </div>
  );

  const FooterSignatures = ({ pageType }: { pageType: 'first' | 'middle' | 'last' }) => (
    <div className="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div className="text-center">
           <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
           <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Médico Ocupacional</p>
           <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Suscrito en todas las páginas</p>
        </div>
        {(pageType === 'first' || pageType === 'last') && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Seguridad e Higiene</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Reg. INPSASEL</p>
          </div>
        )}
        {pageType === 'last' && (
          <div className="text-center">
             <div className="border-t border-slate-800 pt-1"></div>
             <p className="font-bold text-[9px] uppercase">Representante CSSL</p>
             <p className="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Delegado / Patrono</p>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
      <div className="flex justify-between text-[8px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-mono">
         <span>Alex Consulting SVE Report</span>
         <span className="page-number-display">Página </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  );

  if (loading) return <div className="p-8 text-center text-slate-500">Preparando reporte epidemiológico...</div>;

  return (
    <div className="max-w-5xl mx-auto pb-20">

      {/* Controls */}
      <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-8 print:hidden flex flex-col gap-4">
         <div className="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
            <h2 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">Generador SVE (Normativa 2024)</h2>
         </div>
         <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-end">
            <div className="flex-1 min-w-[200px]">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Entidad de Trabajo</label>
               <select 
                 value={selectedCompanyName}
                 onChange={(e) => setSelectedCompanyName(e.target.value)}
                 className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500"
               >
                   <option value="">-- Seleccionar --</option>
                   {companies.map(c => <option key={c.id} value={c.name}>{c.name}</option>)}
               </select>
            </div>
            <div className="w-24">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Año</label>
               <input type="number" value={selectedYear} onChange={e => setSelectedYear(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm" />
            </div>
            <div className="w-32">
               <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mb-1">Trimestre</label>
               <select value={selectedQuarter} onChange={e => setSelectedQuarter(e.target.value as Quarter)} className="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                  <option value="I">Ene-Mar</option>
                  <option value="II">Abr-Jun</option>
                  <option value="III">Jul-Sep</option>
                  <option value="IV">Oct-Dic</option>
               </select>
            </div>
            <button onClick={() => window.print()} className="px-6 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
              <Printer className="w-4 h-4" /> Generar PDF
            </button>
         </div>
      </div>

      {/* REPORT VIEW */}
      <div className="print-container text-slate-900 bg-white md:p-12 print:p-0 rounded-xl shadow-2xl print:shadow-none">

        <style>{`
          @media print {
            body { background: white; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
            .print-hidden { display: none !important; }
            .page-break { 
              page-break-after: always; 
              min-height: 297mm; 
              display: flex; 
              flex-direction: column; 
              padding: 15mm; 
              position: relative;
            }
            .page-break:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
            @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
            .page-number-display::after { content: counter(page); }
          }
